WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.400
A French friend asks: «Tu aimes
la musique ?» You say «Oui».

2
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:07.510
Silence. You try again: «J'aime bien».

3
00:00:07.510 --> 00:00:11.060
Still nothing. The conversation is dying.

4
00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:13.660
Yet French has a whole scale of feeling,

5
00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:18.080
from «j'adore» all the
way down to «je déteste».

6
00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:20.150
So how do you turn a flat 'I like

7
00:00:20.150 --> 00:00:22.420
it' into an answer with an opinion,

8
00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:24.570
a reason and a wish?

9
00:00:24.570 --> 00:00:27.620
In this mission, you'll
climb an opinion thermometer,

10
00:00:27.620 --> 00:00:29.660
from love to hate.

11
00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:32.220
Then you'll build full
answers from word chips,

12
00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:34.780
piece by piece, and test them.

13
00:00:34.780 --> 00:00:38.460
Your mission: build a French
answer that says what you think,

14
00:00:38.460 --> 00:00:41.560
why you think it, and what
you'd love to do next.
